{%- comment -%}
  Homepage hero (aaroma's own section: index.json and the market overlays set its texts, so no setting is renamed).
  FM parity 04.11.2026: same look as magicperfume.co's FM homepage hero (sections/mgx-hero.liquid there, 022e1ce):
  - desktop: the background image fills the section (cover, anchored right), the text side fades into Fade colour,
    copy left in a 1180px column (type = federicomahora.co's hero, see the heading rule), buttons on the bottom edge,
    560px tall;
    hero photo MAGYX 200 (05.11.2026): on wide screens the section grows to 68% of the photo's height and the photo
    sits at 33% from the top, so a tall bottle keeps its cap and base at any width (560px fixed cut the cap from
    ~1500px up). Tablets (701-999px): the photo is height-bound, so the product lands in the right ~330px; the copy
    keeps out of the right 360px there;
  - phones: copy centred on top, the phone image fills the section from the bottom, title scales with the width,
    buttons full width (max 320) a fixed share of the photo height below the copy, so the photo never slides under
    the text;
  - buttons: both solid (Adrian 04.11.2026): Title colour light (e.g. white) = two white buttons, else two black.
  The review pill only shows with "Show review pill" on (magicperfume's hero shows no social proof).
  Settings kept for the editor but no longer used by this look: Image (side image), Background colour, padding,
  mobile image position and mobile button position (the FM layout sets those itself).
  px on purpose: the theme's root font-size is 10px.
  Market texts (04.11.2026): a "Market text" block whose Markets field lists the visitor's market handle
  (localization.market.handle, e.g. "france, switz") replaces the section's texts in that market; an empty field in
  the block keeps the section's text. The first matching block wins. The texts used to sit in the market overlays
  (index.context.*.json), which Shopify can't translate; base blocks can.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign t_review = s.review_text
  assign t_title = s.title
  assign t_subtitle = s.subtitle
  assign t_button = s.button_text
  assign t_button_2 = s.secondary_button_text
  assign hero_market_block = nil
  assign market_needle = localization.market.handle | downcase | prepend: ',' | append: ','
  for block in section.blocks
    if block.type == 'market_text' and block.settings.markets != blank
      assign block_markets = block.settings.markets | downcase | remove: ' ' | prepend: ',' | append: ','
      if block_markets contains market_needle
        assign hero_market_block = block
        break
      endif
    endif
  endfor
  if hero_market_block
    if hero_market_block.settings.review_text != blank
      assign t_review = hero_market_block.settings.review_text
    endif
    if hero_market_block.settings.title != blank
      assign t_title = hero_market_block.settings.title
    endif
    if hero_market_block.settings.subtitle != blank
      assign t_subtitle = hero_market_block.settings.subtitle
    endif
    if hero_market_block.settings.button_text != blank
      assign t_button = hero_market_block.settings.button_text
    endif
    if hero_market_block.settings.secondary_button_text != blank
      assign t_button_2 = hero_market_block.settings.secondary_button_text
    endif
  endif
  assign fade = s.fade_color | default: '#121212'
  assign img = s.background_image
  assign hero_min_h = '560px'
  if img != blank and img.aspect_ratio > 0
    assign hero_min_h = 'max(560px, calc(100vw * 0.68 / ' | append: img.aspect_ratio | append: '))'
  endif
  assign img_mobile = s.mobile_background_image | default: s.background_image
  assign focal_mobile = 'center'
  if img_mobile.presentation.focal_point != blank
    assign focal_mobile = img_mobile.presentation.focal_point
  endif
  assign tone_light = true
  if s.text_color != blank
    assign tone_brightness = s.text_color | color_brightness
    if tone_brightness < 128
      assign tone_light = false
    endif
  endif
  assign hero_classes = 'mgx-hero mgx-hero--btn-bottom'
  if tone_light
    assign hero_classes = hero_classes | append: ' mgx-hero--light'
  endif
  if img_mobile != blank
    assign hero_classes = hero_classes | append: ' mgx-hero--m-cover'
  endif
-%}

<style>
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} {
    position: relative;
    min-height: {{ hero_min_h }};
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, {{ fade | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.55 }} 0%, {{ fade | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.3 }} 34%, {{ fade | color_modify: 'alpha', 0 }} 58%)
      {%- if img != blank -%}, url('{{ img | image_url: width: 2400 }}') right 33% / cover no-repeat{%- endif -%},
      {{ fade }};
  }
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__container {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 36px));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: {{ hero_min_h }};
  }
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__copy {
    max-width: 600px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 701px) and (max-width: 999px) {
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__copy {
      max-width: min(600px, calc(100% - 360px));
    }
  }

  /* Review pill (off unless "Show review pill"): stars + text in a white pill */
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.1);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #121212;
  }
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__stars {
    font-size: inherit;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: #146b32;
  }

  /* Type = federicomahora.co hero 1:1 (Adrian 05.11.2026, "the font and the weight like FM"): same Figtree, FM's
     tokens pm-fs-display / pm-fs-body-lg / pm-fs-button scaled 375 -> 1440, title 500, subtitle 400, buttons 500
     uppercase. Phones use the same scale, so the phone blocks below set no font sizes. */
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} h1.mgx-hero__heading {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    font-size: clamp(32px, calc(32px + 22 * (100vw - 375px) / 1065), 54px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: clamp(38px, calc(38px + 24 * (100vw - 375px) / 1065), 62px);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: {{ s.text_color | default: '#121212' }};
  }
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__subheading {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: clamp(15px, calc(15px + 1 * (100vw - 375px) / 1065), 16px);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: clamp(24px, calc(24px + 2 * (100vw - 375px) / 1065), 26px);
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: {{ s.text_color | default: '#121212' }};
  }

  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__buttons {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: clamp(13px, calc(13px + 1 * (100vw - 375px) / 1065), 14px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: clamp(20px, calc(20px + 2 * (100vw - 375px) / 1065), 22px);
    letter-spacing: 0.125em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  /* Both buttons solid (Adrian 04.11.2026): the second button has the same fill, text colour and size as the first */
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__btn--primary,
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__btn--secondary {
    border: 0;
    background: #121212;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}.mgx-hero--light .mgx-hero__btn--primary,
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}.mgx-hero--light .mgx-hero__btn--secondary {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    color: #121212;
  }

  /* Buttons on the bottom edge: the text stays on top */
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}.mgx-hero--btn-bottom .mgx-hero__inner {
    align-items: stretch;
    padding-block: 56px 48px;
  }
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}.mgx-hero--btn-bottom .mgx-hero__copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}.mgx-hero--btn-bottom .mgx-hero__buttons {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 28px;
  }

  /* Phones: copy centred on top, the photo underneath */
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} {
      min-height: auto;
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, {{ fade | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.94 }} 0%, {{ fade | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.82 }} 34%, {{ fade | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.35 }} 56%, {{ fade | color_modify: 'alpha', 0 }} 74%)
        {%- if img_mobile != blank -%}, url('{{ img_mobile | image_url: width: 1400 }}') right bottom / 190% auto no-repeat{%- endif -%},
        {{ fade }};
    }
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__inner {
      display: block;
      min-height: auto;
      padding-top: 36px;
      padding-bottom: {% if img_mobile != blank %}85vw{% else %}36px{% endif %};
    }
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__copy {
      max-width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__pill {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__subheading {
      margin-inline: auto;
    }
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__buttons {
      justify-content: center;
    }
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }} .mgx-hero__btn {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 320px;
    }

    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}.mgx-hero--btn-bottom .mgx-hero__inner {
      display: flex;
      padding-top: 36px;
      padding-bottom: 28px;
    }
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}.mgx-hero--btn-bottom .mgx-hero__copy {
      width: 100%;
    }
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}.mgx-hero--btn-bottom .mgx-hero__buttons {
      margin-top: {% if img_mobile != blank %}calc(85vw - 28px){% else %}28px{% endif %};
      padding-top: 0;
    }

    /* The phone image fills the section from the bottom; height follows the copy, so a longer title or a short
       phone pushes the photo down instead of sliding it under the text. */
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}.mgx-hero--m-cover {
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, {{ fade }} 0%, {{ fade | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.9 }} 22%, {{ fade | color_modify: 'alpha', 0 }} 42%, {{ fade | color_modify: 'alpha', 0 }} 70%, {{ fade | color_modify: 'alpha', 0.85 }} 100%),
        url('{{ img_mobile | image_url: width: 1400 }}') {{ focal_mobile | split: ' ' | first }} bottom / 100% auto no-repeat,
        {{ fade }};
    }
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}.mgx-hero--m-cover .mgx-hero__inner {
      --mgx-m-photo: calc(100vw / {{ img_mobile.aspect_ratio | default: 0.8 }});
      display: flex;
      min-height: 0;
      padding-top: 28px;
      padding-bottom: 28px;
    }
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}.mgx-hero--m-cover .mgx-hero__copy {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
    }
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}.mgx-hero--m-cover h1.mgx-hero__heading {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}.mgx-hero--m-cover .mgx-hero__subheading {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    #mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}.mgx-hero--m-cover .mgx-hero__buttons {
      margin-top: calc(var(--mgx-m-photo) * 0.6);
      padding-top: 0;
    }
  }
</style>

<section id="mgx-hero-{{ section.id }}" class="{{ hero_classes }}">
  <div class="mgx-hero__container">
    <div class="mgx-hero__inner">
      <div class="mgx-hero__copy"{% if hero_market_block %} {{ hero_market_block.shopify_attributes }}{% endif %}>
        {%- if s.show_review_pill and t_review != blank -%}
          <div class="mgx-hero__pill">
            <span class="mgx-hero__stars" aria-hidden="true">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span>
            <span>{{ t_review }}</span>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if t_title != blank -%}
          <h1 class="mgx-hero__heading homepage-hero__title">{{ t_title }}</h1>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if t_subtitle != blank -%}
          <div class="mgx-hero__subheading homepage-hero__subtitle">{{ t_subtitle }}</div>
        {%- endif -%}

        {%- if t_button != blank or t_button_2 != blank -%}
          <div class="mgx-hero__buttons homepage-hero__buttons">
            {%- if t_button != blank -%}
              <a href="{{ s.button_link | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="mgx-hero__btn mgx-hero__btn--primary">
                {{- t_button -}}
              </a>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if t_button_2 != blank -%}
              <a href="{{ s.secondary_button_link | default: routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="mgx-hero__btn mgx-hero__btn--secondary">
                {{- t_button_2 -}}
              </a>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
  {
    "name": "Homepage Hero",
    "class": "homepage-hero",
    "settings": [
      {
        "type": "color",
        "id": "background_color",
        "label": "Background Color",
        "default": "#fcfbf9"
      },
      {
        "type": "color",
        "id": "fade_color",
        "label": "Fade colour",
        "info": "The text side of the image fades into this colour (also the colour around the phone image).",
        "default": "#121212"
      },
      {
        "type": "checkbox",
        "id": "show_review_pill",
        "label": "Show review pill",
        "info": "Stars + Review Text above the title.",
        "default": false
      },
      {
        "type": "color",
        "id": "text_color",
        "label": "Title and subtitle color",
        "info": "Leave empty to keep the theme's default text color."
      },
      {
        "type": "image_picker",
        "id": "background_image",
        "label": "Background Image"
      },
      {
        "type": "image_picker",
        "id": "mobile_background_image",
        "label": "Mobile Background Image"
      },
      {
        "type": "image_picker",
        "id": "image",
        "label": "Image"
      }, {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "review_text",
        "label": "Review Text",
        "default": "LOVED BY 10,000 CUSTOMERS"
      }, {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "title",
        "label": "Title",
        "default": "Homepage Hero"
      }, {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "subtitle",
        "label": "Subtitle",
        "default": "Homepage Hero"
      }, {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "button_text",
        "label": "Button Text",
        "default": "BUY 3 GET 1 FREE - ENDS SOON!"
      }, {
        "type": "url",
        "id": "button_link",
        "label": "Button Link"
      }, {
        "type": "text",
        "id": "secondary_button_text",
        "label": "Secondary Button Text",
        "default": "Not sure yet? Explore More →"
      }, {
        "type": "url",
        "id": "secondary_button_link",
        "label": "Secondary Button Link"
      }, {
        "type": "header",
        "content": "t:sections.all.padding.section_padding_heading"
      }, {
        "type": "range",
        "id": "padding_top",
        "min": 0,
        "max": 400,
        "step": 4,
        "unit": "px",
        "label": "t:sections.all.padding.padding_top",
        "default": 36
      }, {
        "type": "range",
        "id": "padding_bottom",
        "min": 0,
        "max": 400,
        "step": 4,
        "unit": "px",
        "label": "t:sections.all.padding.padding_bottom",
        "default": 36
      }, {
        "type": "range",
        "id": "mobile_padding_top",
        "min": 0,
        "max": 400,
        "step": 4,
        "unit": "px",
        "label": "Mobile Padding Top",
        "default": 36
      }, {
        "type": "range",
        "id": "mobile_padding_bottom",
        "min": 0,
        "max": 400,
        "step": 4,
        "unit": "px",
        "label": "Mobile Padding Bottom",
        "default": 36
      }, {
        "type": "header",
        "content": "Mobile image position"
      }, {
        "type": "range",
        "id": "mobile_image_offset",
        "min": 0,
        "max": 300,
        "step": 4,
        "unit": "px",
        "label": "Push image down",
        "info": "Moves the mobile background image down so the text sits above it. 0 = image fills the whole hero.",
        "default": 160
      }, {
        "type": "color",
        "id": "mobile_image_fill",
        "label": "Color above the image",
        "info": "Fills the space the image leaves at the top. Match it to the image's top edge.",
        "default": "#0b0200"
      }, {
        "type": "header",
        "content": "Mobile buttons"
      }, {
        "type": "checkbox",
        "id": "mobile_buttons_bottom",
        "label": "Pin buttons to the bottom of the hero",
        "info": "Buttons sit in the bottom padding area. Raise Mobile Padding Bottom if they cover the image.",
        "default": true
      }, {
        "type": "range",
        "id": "mobile_buttons_offset",
        "min": 0,
        "max": 200,
        "step": 4,
        "unit": "px",
        "label": "Distance from bottom",
        "default": 24
      }
    ],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "market_text",
        "name": "Market text",
        "settings": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "id": "markets",
            "label": "Markets",
            "info": "Market handles, comma separated (e.g. france, switz). In these markets the texts below replace the section's texts. Empty fields keep the section's text. Handles only: don't translate this field."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "id": "title",
            "label": "Title"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "id": "subtitle",
            "label": "Subtitle"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "id": "button_text",
            "label": "Button Text"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "id": "secondary_button_text",
            "label": "Secondary Button Text"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "id": "review_text",
            "label": "Review Text"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "presets": [
      {
        "name": "Homepage Hero"
      }
    ]
  }
{% endschema %}